<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - National-Oilwell started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - National-Oilwell started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said on Monday it had started coverage of National-Oilwell Inc with a rating of near- and long-term accumulate.</p>
<p>-- The company's stock opened down 1/4 to 28.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
